{
  "scope": "New real-document holdout for OCR commit 96762259c04921ae8f9493c496ab08e0594ce25b. Eight source files, ten cases. Visually selected and transcribed before first inference. OCR implementation, models, settings and scoring are unchanged. This small, deliberately varied sample is not a representative population estimate; photos and receipts come from the same public collections as earlier documents, but are different files.",
  "exclusions": [
    "Only the five selected original PDF pages are scored; the remaining pages are not assessed.",
    "Signatures, stamps, handwriting, redacted fields, QR codes and barcodes are outside the transcription controls.",
    "Only visible printed school grades, the printed course-hour total and the passport cover are scored on the document photos; no identity or passport validity check is made.",
    "Two sideways PDF pages are processed exactly as published, without prior rotation or image enhancement.",
    "Receipt VAT is compared with the visibly printed amount; it is never calculated from a tax formula. Tiny damaged fiscal details outside the selected blocks are not assessed.",
    "The mixed-VAT receipt's damaged VAT-prefix glyphs are not used for punctuation accuracy; its VAT digits are scored separately.",
    "Empty BI balance row 081 and the wholly empty BI results row 070 are outside the selected table rows. Dash cells in selected rows remain required."
